   "text": "GitHub Actions + scripts\nci.yml: ruff + pytest (136 tests, synthetic data, isolated feature store) + promtool alert tests\ne2e.yml (nightly): docker compose up -> batch -> feature store -> train -> feedback -> serve -> Kafka -> Prometheus\nregistry CLI (promote / rollback), reproduce_champion, feature_store CLI",
   "originalText": "GitHub Actions + scripts\nci.yml: ruff + pytest (136 tests, synthetic data, isolated feature store) + promtool alert tests\ne2e.yml (nightly): docker compose up -> batch -> feature store -> train -> feedback -> serve -> Kafka -> Prometheus\nregistry CLI (promote / rollback), reproduce_champion, feature_store CLI",
